{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-01.png?t=1746322174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lone traveller wakes up, lost and abandoned in the depths of space... Can they harness the forces of the universe around them to navigate this strange, mysterious world, and chart a path back to their origins? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/holu.gif?t=1746322174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-02.png?t=1746322174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the universe from an alien point of view... Solaro's immersive world of exotic planets and star systems can only be accessed with the help of natural forces. Harness the powers of gravity, wind, magnetism, solar energy, and more as you venture deep into wild and extreme worlds untouched by humankind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/ship.gif?t=1746322174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-03.png?t=1746322174\" />You don't speak the language of the locals, and no one can explain to you how these mysterious puzzles work... Think logically, and use your powers of observation. To pass the deadly trials, you'll also need to be quick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-04.png?t=1746322174\" />Solaro's expansive world and soundtrack were created by a single developer over several years. Every fragment of the game has been handcrafted for an original and unique experience. Solaro was created with the open-source game engine Libgdx.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-05.png?t=1746322174\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ vibrant alien worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ unique &quot;orbital puzzles&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12+ hours of core gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12+ hours of optional features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ collectibles and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.5 hours of original music </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1602740?t=1746322174","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/87cd48f6196a1a750d99a72843fda0e351b69231/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746322174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/0bf3e422388588ee1e26021a4518e805c64d3cc6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746322174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/0bf3e422388588ee1e26021a4518e805c64d3cc6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746322174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2801690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset